## Stack and layout

- Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, Tailwind CSS v4, GSAP, TypeScript
- Public site: Swedish default routes plus `/en` (see `src/lib/i18n/`)
- Coach portal: `/coach-login` → `/portal`
- Client portal: `/klient-login` → `/klient`
- `/logga-in` redirects to `/coach-login`
- Portal data: seed in `src/lib/portal/data/`; demo mutations in HMAC-signed cookie `cvb_demo_state`
- Access layer: `src/lib/portal/repository.ts`
- AI: server-only OpenAI in `src/lib/ai/` with context lock in `src/lib/ai/scope.ts`
- Tests: Vitest under `tests/`

